L19: 【14†The 2024 International Collegiate Programming Contest in Hubei Province, China】
L20: ---
L21: Finished
L22: 
L23: → Virtual participation
L24: Virtual contest is a way to take part in past contest, as close as possible to participation on time. It is supported only ICPC mode for virtual contests. If you've seen these problems, a virtual contest is not for you - solve these problems in the archive. If you just want to solve some problem from a contest, a virtual contest is not for you - solve this problem in the archive. Never use someone else's code, read the tutorials or communicate with other person during a virtual contest.
L25: 
L26: [Input]
L27: → Practice?
L28: 
L29: Want to solve the contest problems after the official contest ends? Just register for practice and you will be able to submit solutions.
